ent is already on restored main; normal merge through this PR integrates that history after the external rollback and restoration recorded in the earlier PR description.\n\nValidation: all27 focused cases pass, including all19 original cases. Three actual filesystem regressions fail before the fix and in a compiled metadata-omission copy, then pass with the correction. The normal Release rebuild has zero warnings/errors. All12 restored Hexalith package archives passed normal repository-signature verification; actual public output bodies were matched to their signed members. Required hosted CI and merged-main validation remain required. The original hosted native launch error is still unproved.\n","created_at":"2026-11-05T19:03:24Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T20:58:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2b68f43d6df0f455f5b8390de7fd049ad04a1d4f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/pulls/163/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/pulls/163/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/issues/163/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/statuses/43adaa5d30437bec89f9485d414b1f92342b617c","head":{"label":"Hexalith:fix/retain-reviewed-release-guards","ref":"fix/retain-reviewed-release-guards","sha":"43adaa5d30437bec89f9485d414b1f92342b617c","user":{"login":"Hexalith","id":80614290,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjgwNjE0Mjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80614290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hexalith","html_url":"https://github.com/Hexalith","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hexalith/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/